emiconductor (China) Limited and changed its name to Nexchip Semiconductor Corporation in July 2026. The company was incorporated in 2015 and is based in Hefei, China.","description_en":"Nexchip Semiconductor Corporation engages in the research, development, production, and sale of integrated circuit related products in China and internationally. The company operates a foundry specializing in wafer manufacturing. It offers various integrated circuit categories, including display driver ICs (DDIC) that enable display control, complementary metal-oxide-semiconductor image sensors (CIS) that enable image sensing; power management ICs (PMIC) that regulate and optimize power usage; and Logic ICs, which support data processing, and microcontroller units (MCU). Additionally, the company offers a technology platform portfolio to support the fabrication of DDIC, CIS and PMIC, with Logic IC and MCU scaling. The company caters to a wide range of applications across consumer electronics, automotive electronics, smart home, industrial control, AI, the IoT and memory. Nexchip Semiconductor Corporation was formerly known as Nexchip Semiconductor (China) Limited and changed its name to Nexchip Semiconductor Corporation in July 2026. The company was incorporated in 2015 and is based in Hefei, China.","description_zh":"華虹半導體公司在中國及國際上從事積體電路相關產品的研發、生產和銷售。該公司經營一家專門從事晶圓製造的代工廠。它提供各種積體電路類別，包括實現顯示控制的顯示驅動積體電路（DDIC）、實現圖像感測的互補金屬氧化物半導體圖像感測器（CIS）；調節和優化功耗的電源管理積體電路（PMIC）；以及支援數據處理的邏輯積體電路和微控制器單元（MCU）。此外，該公司還提供技術平台組合，以支援DDIC、CIS和PMIC的製造，並擴展邏輯積體電路和MCU。該公司服務於消費電子、汽車電子、智慧家居、工業控制、人工智慧、物聯網和記憶體等廣泛應用領域。華虹半導體公司前身為華虹半導體（中國）有限公司，並於二零二六年七月更名為華虹半導體公司。該公司於二零一五年成立，總部位於中國合肥。","address":"No. 88, Xifeihe Road","city":"Hefei","state":"AN","zip":"230012","country":"CN","phone":null,"full_address":"No. 88, Xifeihe Road, Hefei, AN, 230012, CN","year_high":37,"year_low":16.95,"range_52w":"16.95-37","all_time_high":null,"all_time_low":null,"inst_ownership_pct":null,"insider_ownership_pct":null,"top_holders":[],"insider_t